    "new_experimental_observations": 0,
    "evidence_tier_promotion": false
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Raw wedge/hash tokens are source drawing instructions, not canonical R/S labels or proof of opposite stereochemistry.",
    "An omitted formalCharge parses as zero; an omitted explicit hydrogen does not establish its physical absence or a complete microstate.",
    "The source prose says free PLP, but this is not evidence for free unbound PLP; the proposed collapse concerns lysine displacement from the substrate-cofactor adduct. No after-state replay is asserted.",
    "Keep M0066 D-glutamate identifiers versus Step1 L-glutamate prose, M0213 direction/terminal-label conflicts and analogue context, and M0186 inferred/assumed later roles and extra-enzymatic steps separate.",
    "Same-source drawings and same-model review do not establish independent chemical or human validation."
  ],
